    "name": "Parfum Nostalgique: Full Bloom Edition",
    "steam_appid": 2437640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437640/extras/8ab3b3b970b3ac49b779f815cddc666e.avif?t=1747188333\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What possessed God to trap a teenage girl into a 265-year-old man's body?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>You wake up late , sleep when you please, and nothing can come between you and cake. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>You love stuffed animals because you can kiss them until they're worn, and fix them when they're torn. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>You love fashion and makeup and shiny, red nails. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's as if this whole city exists watch you dress up and play pretend. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>It's wonderful. You live without shame.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But can you love without shame as well...? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is it so scary to be in love, at your big age? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parfum Nostalgique is a  kinetic visual novel that details a small but eventful window of time in the life of 265 year-old therapist-by-day, dom-by-night vampire, Valdemar Andressen.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Slip into the platform boots of an already too tall 265-year-old therapist-by-day, dom-by-night vampire as he navigates the complexities of love, sex, friendship, the consequences of his actions, confronting his own mortality, the fragility of existence on a floating rock in the endless sea of space, and other lighthearted everyday challenges that come from centuries of life experience.  <br> <br>A heartfelt tale about the people who change us, for better and for worse. From betrayal to unconditional love, from regret to hope, see the drama unfold between old friends, new friends, exes, and lovers when you dive into this kinetic visual novel dram-com series. With delicate vintage shoujo- inspired art, original soundtrack, and a diverse cast of voice actors, Parfum Nostalgique is a lovingly handmade passion project packaged with sweets and scented with roses by sole developer Prince Rosalium for your reading pleasure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437640/extras/8ab3b3b970b3ac49b779f815cddc666e.avif?t=1747188333\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What possessed God to trap a teenage girl into a 265-year-old man's body?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>You wake up late , sleep when you please, and nothing can come between you and cake. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>You love stuffed animals because you can kiss them until they're worn, and fix them when they're torn. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>You love fashion and makeup and shiny, red nails. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's as if this whole city exists watch you dress up and play pretend. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><i>It's wonderful. You live without shame.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But can you love without shame as well...? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is it so scary to be in love, at your big age? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parfum Nostalgique is a  kinetic visual novel that details a small but eventful window of time in the life of 265 year-old therapist-by-day, dom-by-night vampire, Valdemar Andressen.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Slip into the platform boots of an already too tall 265-year-old therapist-by-day, dom-by-night vampire as he navigates the complexities of love, sex, friendship, the consequences of his actions, confronting his own mortality, the fragility of existence on a floating rock in the endless sea of space, and other lighthearted everyday challenges that come from centuries of life experience.  <br> <br>A heartfelt tale about the people who change us, for better and for worse. From betrayal to unconditional love, from regret to hope, see the drama unfold between old friends, new friends, exes, and lovers when you dive into this kinetic visual novel dram-com series. With delicate vintage shoujo- inspired art, original soundtrack, and a diverse cast of voice actors, Parfum Nostalgique is a lovingly handmade passion project packaged with sweets and scented with roses by sole developer Prince Rosalium for your reading pleasure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
